From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matt Graham <matt.sg@hotmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 19:25:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/12] build: renderer selection, SDL3 off Windows, embedded
 HLSL and DXC

The root build picks the D3D11 or SDL3 GPU renderer (XBOXRECOMP_RENDERER).
Every non-Windows host uses SDL3: SDL2 and SDL3 cannot share a process.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 CMakeLists.txt                     |  55 ++++++++--
 cmake/Dxc.cmake                    |  37 +++++++
 cmake/EmbedText.cmake              |  23 ++++
 cmake/Nv2aHlsl.cmake               |  62 +++++++++++
 cmake/Nv2aSdlgpu.cmake             | 102 ++++++++++++++++++
 cmake/Sdl3.cmake                   |  33 ++++++
 cmake/sdl3-d3d12-descriptors.patch |  27 +++++
 include/xbox/xboxrecomp.h          |  10 +-
 src/README.md                      | 168 ++++++++---------------------
 9 files changed, 385 insertions(+), 132 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 cmake/Dxc.cmake
 create mode 100644 cmake/EmbedText.cmake
